WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110
Can a probability be bigger than 1?

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:10.170
Never. 0 is impossible, 1 is certain, everything else sits between.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:21.013
A chance of 1 means it must happen, like rolling a number from 1 to 6 on a normal die. And 0 means it never can, like rolling a 7.
